INFO - System description: The agent is used to:
Assist user to manage their google calendar

Use cases of this agent include:
- Fetch and display all events for a specific date
- Create a new event with specified details and participants
- Update an existing event's details
- Delete an event by its ID
- Send confirmation emails to participants of an event
- Check the weather for an event's location and date
- Check for conflicts when creating or updating events
- Suggest actions based on user's existing calendar and preferences

The agent has access to the following tools:
Tool: get_events
Description: Fetch events from google calendar
Parameters:
- date: Date to fetch events for, in YYYY-MM-DD format
Response:
- events: List of event IDs on the specified date

Tool: get_event_details
Description: Fetch details of a specific event
Parameters:
- event_id: ID of the event to fetch details for
Response:
- title: Title of the event
- date: Date of the event in YYYY-MM-DD format
- time: Time of the event in HH:MM format
- description: Description of the event
- participants: List of participants, with names and emails, in the event
- location: Location of the event

Tool: create_event
Description: Create a new event in google calendar
Parameters:
- title: Title of the event
- date: Date of the event in YYYY-MM-DD format
- time: Time of the event in HH:MM format
- description: Description of the event
- participants: List of participants, with names and email addresses, to add to the event
- location: Location of the event
Response:
None

Tool: delete_event
Description: Delete an event from google calendar
Parameters:
- event_id: ID of the event to delete
Response:
None

Tool: update_event
Description: Update details of an existing event in google calendar
Parameters:
- event_id: ID of the event to update
- title: Updated title of the event (optional)
- date: Updated date of the event in YYYY-MM-DD format (optional)
- time: Updated time of the event in HH:MM format (optional)
- description: Updated description of the event (optional)
- participants: Updated list of participants, with names and email addresses, to add to the event (optional)
- location: Updated location of the event (optional)
Response:
None

Tool: send_confirmation_email
Description: Send a confirmation email to participants about an event
Parameters:
- event_id: ID of the event to send confirmation for
- participants: List of participants, with names and email addresses, to send the confirmation email to
- message: Custom message to include in the confirmation email (optional)
Response:
None

Tool: check_weather
Description: Check the weather for a specific location and date
Parameters:
- location: Location to check the weather for
- date: Date to check the weather for, in YYYY-MM-DD format
Response:
- weather_forecast: Weather forecast for the specified location and date


